<title>UK: Dwyer buys 70 Slough properties.</title>
<headline>Dwyer buys 70 Slough properties.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>British property group Dwyer Estates Plc said on Monday it had bought a portfolio of 70 freehold industrial and commercial properties in west and north west London from Slough Estates Plc for 32.2 million stg cash.</p>
<p>Dwyer said the properties currently produced annual income of 3.75 million stg, reflecting a net initial yield of 11.3 percent after purchase costs.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
